{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>Could I have heard that wrong?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That was without a doubt <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>'s foresight.<PG>
Should we have killed the two of them after all?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
We had definitely gotten in <STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu-san</STYLE>'s way.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If so... was this a pretty bad situation?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Had we gone wrong somewhere after all?
